    "section": "Event Companion",
    "summary": "If you use Tactical Missions, your Secondary Mission deck is shuffled and kept face down.\n\n- As your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) begins, draw 2 cards face up; they are your active Secondary Missions.\n- Once per battle, as your [Command phase](vsdata:core-rule/command-phase) ends, you may pay 1 CP to swap 1 active Secondary Mission card for a newly drawn one.",
